Title: Chapter 7: What the Meditators Knew
Output-Formats:
Tagline: The metacognitive layer that makes the return to sources productive rather than mechanical. Hitbonenut, vipassana, theoria, muraqaba, different names for the same practice. Plus the limit of calibration, which is a reading taken inside the instrument's range, and the router that has to run before the work rather than after it.
